      "id": "claim_a4f4f61f5df046d8856064bc86e5699a",
      "statement": "GPT-OSS-Lite supports Python 3.10+ and PyTorch 2.1+; `requirements.txt` installs PyTorch, safetensors, PyYAML, tqdm, and WandB, while CPU-only environments can run architecture tests and the analytical KV benchmark but not the CUDA-dependent production and GPU smoke paths.",
