      "statement": "The canonical production configuration is a roughly 502M-total, 247M-active model with 12 layers, 8 query heads and 4 KV heads, top-2 routing over 8 routed experts plus one shared expert, BF16, 4096-token training sequences, a 131072-token evaluation target, and a 2000-step checkpoint interval.",
